{"id":"vod_sn_35716","vodId":"35716","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"天上天下","name_cn":"天上天下","date":"2004-01-01","year":"2004","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/995b049d0c600f7614e16752bd47debd.jpg"},"summary":"凪宗一郎（保志总一朗 配音）和卜比牧原（三木真一郎 配音）的到来让本来平静的统道学园鸡犬不宁。虽然统道学园是一所武校，但学校提倡平和理智的武道，反对无因的暴力，而宗一郎和牧原两人此次的目的却是征服这座学校。结果可想而知，宗一郎被前来的柔剑部部长枣真夜（久川绫 配音）及高柳雅孝（关智一 配音）一脚踢飞，倒霉的他掉入了刚洗完澡的枣亚夜（茅原实里 配音）身上，没想到枣亚夜对他一见钟情。于是，有着女性恐惧症的宗一郎在统道学园的快乐生活开始了。　　而随着校园生活的推进，一些被称为“柱”的标志逐渐浮出水面，这些标志分别刻在谁的上？又代表了什么？宗一郎决定一探究竟。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:37:04","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rmaccTcdgf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LebUkN5i321/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/w7agEp8m2N1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Bz8yJGh19e1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Zumpu6zHth1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CLE7k02nXC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7dXr7rgr4K1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/W2qCdDE2y51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RNbhzVTmQY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DC5Tp6pTfY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ACvT4Ngjms1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PLsf60eY3P1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9kMDPbTRW91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nmUJuzmmme1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"h